Package: multiflexi-semaphore
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, php-vitexsoftware-multiflexi-core, multiflexi-cli (>= 2.2.0)
Description: MultiFlexi Semaphore UI credential prototype and action
 Semaphore UI REST API credential prototype for MultiFlexi core.
 Provides the CredentialProtoType class that defines SEMAPHORE_URL and
 SEMAPHORE_TOKEN configuration fields, plus the MultiFlexi\Action\Semaphore
 action which triggers Ansible playbooks as Semaphore tasks using such
 a credential.

Package: multiflexi-semaphore-ui
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, multiflexi-semaphore (= ${binary:Version}), multiflexi-web|multiflexi-web5
Description: MultiFlexi Semaphore UI components
 Semaphore credential dialog for MultiFlexi web interface.
 Probes /api/user with the configured token and shows the token owner.
